WEBVTT

00:10:29.292 --> 00:10:31.393
will help power economic growth.

00:10:31.417 --> 00:10:35.476
Renewable energy offers India
a cleaner and more prosperous future

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.476
than coal ever can.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:39.809
Unless we hasten the transition,

00:10:39.833 --> 00:10:43.976
air pollution and climate change
will continue to ravage the country

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.143
and endanger the planet.

00:10:46.167 --> 00:10:49.184
So, let's get to work.

00:10:49.208 --> 00:10:50.458
Thank you.